  purify ⟮✨Twin✨Unentangled✨Omens✨᛫ Augurglass☿✨unfold✨the✨second✨casting✨᛫ Augurglass☿✨unfold✨the✨carried✨omen✨᛫ ✨gather✨a✨counted✨chorus✨᛫ ✨Weight✨of✨Each✨Face✨᛫ ✨split✨the✨twin✨portent✨⟯
